/v1/","context":{"app_id":2231090,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2231090","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:31:41Z","value":4,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=2243290","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2231090-1847286114034468","game_id":"steam-2231090","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Linux & Intel Mac Fix","summary":"Hi, another update:Fixed rendering issues on some Linux and Intel Mac devices (thanks ThinkWithGames)Game has a proper icon now instead of a default Unity oneOther minor bugfixes that you probably don't care about, but I doAs always thanks folks,- Ariel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:44:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034468","verified_at":"2026-10-23T00:39:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2231090-1847286114029737","game_id":"steam-2231090","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: High Contrast Mode and other","summary":"Hi! Small demo update:High contrast option for palettes (feedback from Miley's negative demo review)Translation fixes for Chinese Simplified (thanks YuLun)Fixed mouse pointer inaccuaracy in menus (thanks YuLun again)Updated local fallback offline highscores/histograms in cases when you can't connect to the scores server (it's in the US, your country may have some firewall or there's some other reason preventing you from connecting to the server...). Instead of empty histograms/highscores you'll ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T17:18:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029737","verified_at":"2026-10-21T21:40:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2231090-1846651706682997","game_id":"steam-2231090","kind":"announcement","title":"Number Machine + Zachtronics = Bundle 👏","summary":"Hello!I'm very happy to announce that Number Machine will be bundled at launch with two classic Zachtronics games that directly inspired it: Opus Magnum and Infinifactory. All three games will also be discounted at the launch of Number Machine.The similarities to Opus Magnum are obvious, but the satisfying gameplay of Infinifactory was also a major source of inspiration. Both of these are my personal top factory games. Special thanks to Zach Barth of Zachtronics for making this possible.Cheers f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T20:19:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682997","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2231090-1845383656390755","game_id":"steam-2231090","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO IS OUT NOW! 👀","summary":"Hello!I'm happy to inform you that the demo for Number Machine is out right now. Yes, you can open it and take it for a spin! In the demo you will find:Mini campaign with 10 levels.A bunch of beginner tutorial levels and a few more open ended harder ones.Histograms, world records and friend scores. All fully server side verified!Full controller support for the couch homies.Have feedback? Feel free to post in the Steam discussions or on the official Discord channel.Thank you, - Ariel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T08:29:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390755","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2231090-1842846814455691","game_id":"steam-2231090","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo, Release, Bundles and Fests","summary":"Hello! I've been working a lot lately to get Number Machine into your fingers and I've got a bunch of news to share about my upcoming colorful nerdy factory game. DemoYou can expect the demo to be released around the end of this month, September 2026. It'll have a mini campaign with fully server side verified online highscores, for each level as well as the campaign as a whole. ReleaseThe game will fully release on November 6th 2026 with a 2 week discount. I'm really excited (and nervous) to pub","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T13:43:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455691","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2231090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:47Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:47Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2231090":"2026-10-26T09:52:47Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2231090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:47Z"},"2243290":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:47Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2231090","app_id":2231090,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"7aeeda52d7b467a6c78991